<?php $source=substr($tab,0,-6);?><div class="card"><span class="eyebrow">BUSINESS DISCOVERY</span><h2><?=e(BusinessLeads::SOURCES[$source])?> lead generator</h2><p>Search by business type and city. Results are saved without duplicates. Contact details are included only when published by the source.</p><?php if(!Launch::ready()):?><p>Run cron/migrate-launch.php to install lead storage.</p><?php else:?><p class="badge"><?=cfg('LEADS_API_KEY')||cfg('RANKING_API_KEY')?'Service key configured':'Service key required in server configuration'?></p><form data-api="admin/lead-search"><input type="hidden" name="source" value="<?=e($source)?>"><div class="form-grid"><?php field('keyword','Business type (e.g. dentists)');field('location','City / region (e.g. New York, NY)');field('page','Result page','number',1);if($source==='google-maps')field('coordinates','Map coordinates (required for page 2+; e.g. @40.7128,-74.0060,14z)','text','',false);?></div><button class="button">Find & save leads</button></form><p class="small">Each search uses service credits. Yelp and Yellow Pages coverage varies by market.</p></div><div class="card stack"><div class="row between"><h2>Saved leads</h2><form method="post" action="<?=url('/api/v1/admin/lead-export')?>"><?php csrf_field();?><input type="hidden" name="source" value="<?=e($source)?>"><button class="button secondary">Export CSV</button></form></div><?php table(['business_name'=>'Business','phone'=>'Phone','website'=>'Website','address'=>'Address','listing_url'=>'Source listing'],rows('SELECT * FROM zentro_leads WHERE source=? ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 200',[$source]));?><p class="small">Showing the latest 200 leads. CSV exports up to 10,000.</p><?php endif;?></div>
